                 r"And one identity: the unital part ($H_{\rm LD}$ and dephasing only) leaves $I/d$ stationary --- heat death is a fixed point \textsf{[ONTO]} --- in " + str(_n2ok4) + r" of " + str(len(_n2_4)) + r" dimensions (that part's attractor is unique in " + str(_n2u4) + r"). "
                 r"(T4) \emph{The stress}: " + _i4(_t4.get("instances")) + r" instances of the template with coefficients, rates, $K$, $H$ and basis drawn (" + _i4(_t4.get("rotated")) + r" with a Haar rotation): " + _i4(_t4.get("identity_violations")) + r" identity violations; the six per-instance identities (the spectral zero, complete positivity, trace, positivity and residual of the stationary state, Spohn) all checked in " + _i4(_t4.get("all_identities_checked")) + r" instances (non-return is checked in T2); unique attractor in " + _i4(_t4.get("unique")) + r".")
        _cpu4 = r"agrees" if _cr4.get("ok") else r"\textbf{does not agree}"   # here the verdict is a success, which requires the CPU to agree; otherwise it is said with RESULTS_VOID
        s.append(r"\textbf{Scale and reference.} " + ((r"At $d=128$ (a $16\,384\times16\,384$ superoperator): attractor \texttt{" + _tt4(_d8.get("status")) + r"}, " + ((r"$\mathrm{CCI}=" + _f4(_d8.get("cci"), 4) + r"$") if _fin4(_d8.get("cci")) else r"CCI undefined") + r", full spectrum in " + _f4((_d8.get("spectrum_s") or 0) / 60.0, 1) + r" min. ")
                 if _d8.get("ran") else ((r"The $d=128$ point started and was interrupted in this run. ") if _d8sc4 == "STARTED" else (r"The $d=128$ point did not run in this run (\texttt{" + _tt4(_d8sc4 or "n/a") + r"}). "))) +
                 r"A CPU reference, independent in the linear algebra (numpy/LAPACK, a separate process, with the same construction of the operators), read " + _i4(_cr4.get("read")) + r" points of T2, compared " + _i4(_cr4.get("compared")) + r" (" + _i4(_cr4.get("near_threshold_not_compared")) + r" near the gap threshold, reported and not compared) and " + _cpu4 + r" (largest CCI difference $" + _e4((_cr4.get("max_diffs") or {}).get("cci")) + r"$; $n(c^2)$ for information only).")
    s.append(r"\textbf{What it is and what it is not.} All of this is computation of the theory's system \textsf{[COMPUTED]}, not a measurement of nature. Three honesties were stated before the computation, in the pre-registration: "
             r"the fold hierarchy $D(c^1)>D(c^2)>D(c^3)>0$ holds for every state with two distinct non-zero eigenvalues (on a state flat on its support, equality holds) --- it is mathematics, not a test; "
             r"in exact arithmetic, the separation of the root law in T1 is structural (only $L_{\rm anti}$ has a diagonal component), so T1 tests the instrument; "
             r"and the identities (the spectral zero, positivity, trace, Spohn, non-return, the unital part) fail only if the engine errs. What can genuinely fail is the uniqueness of the attractor, its weight in $\Pi$ and the values of the folds --- on the grid. "
             r"The pre-registration's specification is frozen by hash (\texttt{" + _tt4(str(_pf4.get("spec_sha256", "n/a"))[:16]) + r"}); the document, by \texttt{" + _tt4(str((_pff4.get("json") or {}).get("sha256", "n/a"))[:16])
             + r"} (JSON) and \texttt{" + _tt4(str((_pff4.get("md") or {}).get("sha256", "n/a"))[:16]) + r"} (MD); the gate does not move."
             + ((r" The GPU took " + _f4(_tot4, 0) + r" min in this run.") if (_tot4 and not _reuse4) else ""))
    s.append(r"\begin{center}\small\texttt{" + _tt4(_v4 or "TGL_QUANTUM_PILLAR_V1__ABSENT") + r"}\end{center}")   # \_ already breaks in the PDF (preamble); the TXT keeps the verdict as one token
